<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Muhammad V of Adal</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">executed <a href="/years/1577">1577</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Sultan Muhammad V</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Muhammad V was a sultan of Adal in the late sixteenth century. He was defeated by the Ethiopian emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sarsa-dengel">Sarsa Dengel</a> and executed in 1577. His death was part of the series of defeats that ended the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adal-sultanate">Adal Sultanate</a> as a military power.</p></div>
